[[ja:都萬神社]]
{{infobox religious building|image=Tsuma-jinja haiden-1.JPG}}
Tsuma Shrine is a [[Soja shrine]] in [[Miyazaki Prefecture]], [[Japan]]. It is a soja shrine, which means it enshrines all the kami of [[Hyūga Province]] so the governor could visit all of them easily.

